        "created_at": "2016-12-18T22:21:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m wondering if there’s a special ruling that applies here that I’m unaware of.<br>\nPlaying in the Temple, Dr. Medico and Idealist became incapacitated.<br>\nI discarded the required number of cards for Rites of Revival.<br>\nI then got the message “7 hero cards have been discarded, but no heros are incapacitated!” (Not sure of the exact wording, it was quite quick.)</p>\n<p>Each of the Sentinels are certainly a hero character card, and the word “Incapacitated” is clearly printed on their back side.<br>\nThey’re even refered to as “Incapacitated” on some of their own cards.</p>\n<p>Any insight?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:32.273Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
