        "created_at": "2016-12-18T23:25:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>They aren’t incapacitated unless all 4 of them are. The four of them, collectively, count as one hero. So if all 4 of them were down, you could have brought them all back at once with the Rites.</p>",
