        "created_at": "2016-12-19T17:39:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>All 4 need to be incapped to bring back 1!? Yikes!<br>\nYou know, I’ve always liked the Sentinels, but I’m getting to like them even more now that I’m learning what situations their uniqueness causes them to excel in and what situations they have extra trouble with.</p>\n<p>Or as I like to say:<br>\nPHENOMENAL COSMIC POWER! ittybittyhittypoints</p>",
